	(gr_text "U1 BGA escape vias: 0.15 mm drill / 0.25 mm diameter vias shall be epoxy-filled and copper-capped /plated over\nwhere located under or near U1 BGA pads. No open vias on BGA pads.\nOther component through-holes shall remain open and solderable.\n"
